cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper and this software release."
title: "CIF Magnetic Reference Filter"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Contributors"
    given-names: "CIF Magnetic Reference Filter"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  CIF-only structural/chemical descriptor workflow and reference-manifold
  screening model for ranking crystal structures by proximity to empirical
  magnetic and non-magnetic reference materials. Nearest reference branch is
  affinity to a reference manifold and is not a prediction of magnetic ground state.
